":"ato","d":"2017-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Haefner","x":"And again, I mean, from our perspective, the sole benefit of that is to our LDC and other tariff customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2017 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2017-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Michael Haefner","x":"Through the Rider REV mechanism, there's a credit back to the tariff ratepayers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2017 Q3","e":"ato","d":"2017-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kim Cocklin","x":"The issue on appeal is whether our annual rate filing complies with the tariff.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2017 Q4","e":"ato","d":"2017-11-10","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael Haefner","x":"Building on our strong foundation, high-quality assets, very capable leaders and healthy culture, Kim recognized the need to invest in our infrastructure, and he guided the restructuring of our rate mechanisms to make those investments feasible.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2018 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2018-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"Income taxes, including the determination of our rates, like other costs are passed through to our customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2018 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2018-02-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"Beginning in the second quarter, our revenues reflect the lower tax rate that would pass through to customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2018 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2018-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"Stronger-than-planned customer consumption in our distribution segment and transportation revenue trend in both the distribution and pipeline storage segments have increased our outlook for our contribution margins.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2019 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2019-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Forsythe","x":"APT's tariff customers continue to benefit from this mechanism, while our distribution customers in Texas receive the benefit of low cost of gas produced in this region.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2019 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2019-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Forsythe","x":"But as I indicated, with the maintenance work that we have planned for the pipe - the summer, combined with the effect of the Rider REV mechanism and how we share - 75% of that upside benefit flows back to the tariff customers on APT, we expect that to - that impact to be modest for us.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2020 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2020-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"And remember too on this competitive pipeline and we've been talking about this for a couple of years, the non-tariff businesses that run through the pipeline that represents a relatively small piece of the overall puzzle for APT, primarily due to the existence of a Rider REV mechanism.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2020 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2020-02-05","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Ryan Levine","x":"I was wondering what impact the new PHMSA regulation have in your increased guidance for 2020 versus 2019.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2020 Q3","e":"ato","d":"2020-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Aga Zmigrodzka","x":"And how much of cost savings you're expecting going forward kind of more sustainable?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2021 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2021-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"As a reminder, gas costs are a pass-through cost and recover in all of our jurisdictions.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2022 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2022-02-09","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Julien Dumoulin-Smith","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2024 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2024-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"So we felt it was prudent to maintain the guidance in this range at this point and provide a more thorough update once we get through the winter heating season.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2024 Q3","e":"ato","d":"2024-08-08","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Nicholas Campanella","x":"And how are you benchmarking with a 3.5% annual increase guidance?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2025 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2025-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Christopher Forsythe","x":"Finally, we experienced a $5 million increase in APT's system safety and tariff expense, which is offset by a corresponding increase in revenue as a result of APT's new system safety and integrity mechanism.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2025 Q1","e":"ato","d":"2025-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Akers","x":"On the tariff piece of it, to that part of your question, just saw recently where those were put on pause.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"ATO 2025 Q2","e":"ato","d":"2025-05-08","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Forsythe","x":"APT also experienced an $8 million increase due to higher capacity contracted by tariff-based customers due to their growing peak